Fonts in this directory
=======================

Special Elite — Brian J. Bonislawsky / Astigmatic (Cosmic Patterns)
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Special+Elite

Courier Prime — Alan Dague-Greene
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Courier+Prime

Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, which permits
use, modification and redistribution, including bundling with a website.
Full text: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

Files here are the latin-subset woff2 builds served by Google Fonts, kept
locally so that loading a page makes no request to a third party.
